step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Speak with the Observatory professor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Give the Observatory professor the three planks, bronze bar and molten glass (speak to him 3 separate times each time).</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the assistant.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go up the east hill and down the stairs.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Once downstairs, search all the chests until you find the <col=800000>goblin kitchen key</col> (most commonly found in south-eastern part when you go down the stairs, don't skip the dialogue once you find the key or you will not pick it up. If not found in the two chests directly south-east from the stairs, it is guaranteed to be in the last chest in the dungeon. The other chests will contain poisonous spiders.).</col>
